  <History Date="14-09-15" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added colour names, changed gobo 1 to 8bit and renamed autofocus to reserved in line with latest spec." Version="2" />
  <History Date="23-09-15" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Updated to v1.1 spec in response to manufacturer request." Version="3" />
  <History Date="23-09-15" Author="Peter Budd" Comment="Added physical Pan Tilt times to the personality, and added open ranges to gobo 2." Version="4" />
  <History Date="11-12-15" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Updated to v1.2 spec in response to manufacturer request (control functions and associated macros)" Version="5" />
